# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). From the Sunken Temple steps of 24-hinterlands.guide and
# 27-steppes-ardentes.guide (sources: Polestar's Forever data and Dungeons codex; Jammal'an behind the
# six troll champions of the upper level: Warcraft Tavern's Forever Sunken Temple quest guide read on
# 12/11/2026, written from Classic; the statues' order of Secret of the Circle from the original
# game). Not played in game yet: places inside are to check in game.
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's own route: the Groupe Alliance module offers it at the end of
# the Blasted Lands part of forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes (the bloodmages' hand-ins at
# Nethergarde Keep, about level 51), when the route is a short ride from the Pool of Tears and is
# about to leave for Ironforge. It opens in a tab of its own: Brohann in Stormwind for whoever has
# not taken his quest, the Swamp of Sorrows, the temple, then Brohann again in Stormwind, from where
# the Deeprun Tram joins the route's next stop, Ironforge.
#
# Compared with Polestar 0.4.2.2's own Sunken Temple page (Dungeons codex, Polestar_Codex, GPL-3.0,
# page "sunken-temple"; out of its route, data/dungeon-runs.json "notInRoute": the route passes the
# temple at 40-43, below its quests):
# - Into the Depths and Secret of the Circle (3446, 3447, Marvon Rivetseeker at the Broken Pillar in
#   Tanaris): on its page, not in this pack before (its note said they opened only after the run).
#   They need The Stone Circle (3444), which Polestar's route hands in to Marvon at about 49.5
#   (40-50/07-un-goro-crater): this pack's tip on 3444 (Tips.lua) says to take them then; both are
#   handed in inside the temple;
# - Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar (1475): its chain (1448 to 1469) is done by the route, Brohann's
#   last turn-in at about 48 (40-50/05-the-hinterlands): this pack's tip on 1469 says to take 1475
#   then; otherwise this chapter starts with it;
# - The Essence of Eranikus (3373): kept, optional;
# - on its page, left out: Jammal'an the Prophet (1446, the Atal'ai Exile in the Hinterlands, a visit
#   before and after the run that the route no longer makes), the class quests of level 52 (8232,
#   8236, 8253, 8257, 8418, 8422, 8425, 9053: their chains open later on the route, in Azshara and
#   beyond), Haze of Evil (4143, Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas, later on the route), The God Hakkar
#   (3528, after The Prophecy of Mosh'aru, not on the route).
guide groupe-alliance/temple-englouti
title Dungeon · The Sunken Temple (50-56)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 50-56
zone Swamp of Sorrows

step Stormwind: Brohann Caskbelly
  when !onquest 1475
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The Sunken Temple: a troll and dragon dungeon under the Pool of Tears in the Swamp of Sorrows, levels 50 to 60, best from about 52 with a group of 5: its last bosses are 55. Its main quest is Brohann Caskbelly's, in Stormwind: from Nethergarde Keep, the flight to Stormwind and back, about 7 minutes.
  accept 1475                         -- Brohann Caskbelly

step Sunken Temple: the Pool of Tears
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Ride north out of the Blasted Lands into the Swamp of Sorrows, then east past Stonard (Horde) to the Pool of Tears. The temple lies under the water: swim down into it and find the dungeon's entrance inside.
  note Group of 5. Keep 4 free quest log slots. In the quest log before going in: Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar (Brohann Caskbelly, Stormwind); for whoever took them at the Broken Pillar in Tanaris, Into the Depths and Secret of the Circle (Marvon Rivetseeker). Share each one with the group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  goto 69.9,53.5 "Sunken Temple" r 25

step Sunken Temple: the circle and the Altar of Hakkar
  when onquest 3446,3447
  tip On the upper ring, six Atal'ai statues stand around the central pit: click them in this order, south, north, south-west, south-east, north-west, north-east (the original game's order, to check in game); the Idol of Hakkar rises, with a chest. The Altar of Hakkar is at the bottom of the central pit, where Atal'alarion waits.
  turnin 3447 object 148838           -- Idol of Hakkar: Secret of the Circle, from Marvon Rivetseeker at the Broken Pillar in Tanaris
  turnin 3446 object 148836           -- Altar of Hakkar, in the temple's lowest hall: Into the Depths, from Marvon Rivetseeker

step Sunken Temple: the tablets and Jammal'an
  tip The Atal'ai Tablets lie in the temple's halls: pick them up as you clear. Jammal'an the Prophet waits on the upper level, once the six troll champions of the balconies around the central pit are dead.
  collect 6288 x10 quest 1475         -- Atal'ai Tablet

step Sunken Temple: the Shade of Eranikus
  tip The Shade of Eranikus waits at the very end, past the green dragons. He drops the Essence of Eranikus: right-click it, then hand it in at the Essence Font in his room before leaving.
  kill 5709                           -- Shade of Eranikus
  accept 3373 item 10454 optional     -- Essence of Eranikus, a drop
  turnin 3373 object 148512           -- Essence Font

step Stormwind: Brohann Caskbelly
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Out of the Swamp of Sorrows to Nethergarde Keep, then the flight to Stormwind. Last stop of the chapter: the route's own guide comes back once this is handed in; its next stop, Ironforge, is a ride on the Deeprun Tram.
  turnin 1475                         -- Brohann Caskbelly
